\\ arith.6502 - the arithmetic macros' constant data: EXP2_16's way into its run of shifts.

\\ For a whole part n of 8 to 15, the bytes of EXP2_16's run of seven shifts (ASL A:ROL high, 3
\\ bytes each) to skip, so that n - 8 are left: 3 * (15 - n). Read by n, from exp2_skip-8.

    FITPAGE_FROM -8, 16
.exp2_skip  EQUB 3*(15-(8..15))
